    "excerpt": "A deep dive into the career of Demis Hassabis, the co-founder of DeepMind, and his quest to solve intelligence to solve everything else.",
    "technicalInsight": "Hassabis's approach combines neuroscience-inspired architectures with reinforcement learning to create general-purpose problem solvers.",
